# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
#
# Defense-in-depth deny-list. The Dockerfile uses explicit per-directory
# COPY directives (cmd/, api/, internal/, db/migrations/), so the build
# context surface is already small. This file additionally excludes
# directories that should NEVER enter the build context even if a future
# Dockerfile change reintroduces `COPY . .`.
bin/
# Devtools-container persistent Go module/build cache + kubeconfig (mounted
# from host at runtime — copying it into the Docker build context bloats
# the image and can exhaust disk on shallow runners).
.gocache/
# Git metadata: large, churny, and never needed by the builder or runtime.
.git/
